␀␀␀␀␀¼¿␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀³␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Pþ␀␀␀␀␀Pþ␀␀␀␀␀Dù␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀”÷␀␀␀␀␀”÷␀␀␀␀␀°)#␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀7␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ ␀␀␀␀P!5␀␀␀␀␀P!5␀␀␀␀␀Ð␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀n␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ q5␀␀␀␀␀ 15␀␀␀␀␀Àá␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀½␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀àR6␀␀␀␀␀à6␀␀␀␀␀°␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀T6␀␀␀␀␀6␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀)␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Y6␀␀␀␀␀6␀␀␀␀␀ð␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¤␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€a6␀␀␀␀␀€!6␀␀␀␀␀€␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ø␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€¡6␀␀␀␀␀€!6␀␀␀␀␀÷␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀˜˜7␀␀␀␀␀”7␀␀␀␀␀ˆ>␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀”7␀␀␀␀␀3␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Æ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ç7␀␀␀␀␀Þ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀PK␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀âéŽ"~␀~␀␀␀␀bin/git-cvsserver#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/perl

use lib (split(/:/, $ENV{GITPERLLIB} || '/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/share/perl5'));

####
#### This application is a CVS emulation layer for git.
#### It is intended for clients to connect over SSH.
#### See the documentation for more details.
####
